msgstr ""

msgid "Thermal Averager needle"
msgstr ""

msgid "If true, the vario gauge will display a thermal averager needle instead of the current climb-rate needle. During cruise, this needle displays the last thermal average netto value. During circling, this needle displays the average net value."
msgstr ""

